1
00:00:16,333 --> 00:00:17,333
Song Yi.

2
00:00:17,766 --> 00:00:19,133
I hear you're a senior now.

3
00:00:19,333 --> 00:00:20,633
So you graduate soon?

4
00:00:21,733 --> 00:00:22,733
Yes.

5
00:00:22,800 --> 00:00:24,466
My final exams are next month.

6
00:00:26,066 --> 00:00:28,300
Then shouldn't you be heading back?

7
00:00:28,500 --> 00:00:30,533
You'll want time to prepare, won't you?

8
00:00:31,266 --> 00:00:32,066
Mom..!

9
00:00:32,233 --> 00:00:34,366
I'm just looking out for him.

10
00:00:35,733 --> 00:00:36,765
Why don't I

11
00:00:36,766 --> 00:00:38,033
book you a flight?

12
00:00:38,333 --> 00:00:41,633
Consider it a thank-you for
taking such good care of my son.

13
00:00:43,866 --> 00:00:44,866
No need, Auntie.

14
00:00:45,633 --> 00:00:46,733
I haven't picked a date.

15
00:00:47,166 --> 00:00:48,866
I might stay at Yong Qi's a while.

16
00:00:49,633 --> 00:00:50,633
If you need me

17
00:00:50,900 --> 00:00:52,166
just call me anytime.

18
00:00:52,300 --> 00:00:53,300
What?

19
00:00:53,533 --> 00:00:54,533
You're moving out?

20
00:00:56,000 --> 00:00:57,600
It's not really moving out.

21
00:00:57,933 --> 00:00:59,266
Yong Qi's place is close by.

22
00:00:59,500 --> 00:01:00,732
We can meet anytime.

23
00:01:00,733 --> 00:01:01,899
Even so, no!

24
00:01:01,900 --> 00:01:02,900
Feiyu.

25
00:01:03,333 --> 00:01:04,600
Don't be rude.

26
00:01:11,833 --> 00:01:13,833
I'm just going there to study.

27
00:01:14,466 --> 00:01:15,400
I'm not leaving.

28
00:01:15,401 --> 00:01:16,833
That is moving out.

29
00:01:17,066 --> 00:01:18,299
That's not what you said!

30
00:01:18,300 --> 00:01:19,300
Xu Feiyu.

31
00:01:19,666 --> 00:01:21,566
Speaking to a guest like that

32
00:01:21,933 --> 00:01:23,000
is unacceptable.

33
00:01:28,733 --> 00:01:29,533
Hey?

34
00:01:29,633 --> 00:01:31,100
Where... where are you going?

35
00:01:32,000 --> 00:01:33,333
You're not eating?

36
00:01:58,200 --> 00:01:59,533
Don't worry.

37
00:02:00,033 --> 00:02:01,733
He'll sulk a while then be fine.

38
00:02:03,033 --> 00:02:04,733
Take this with you.

39
00:02:06,066 --> 00:02:07,066
This is...

40
00:02:08,600 --> 00:02:09,600
All these years

41
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:11,833
he's never recovered.

42
00:02:12,633 --> 00:02:13,733
From now on

43
00:02:14,333 --> 00:02:15,466
if you miss him

44
00:02:15,666 --> 00:02:17,033
look at this.

45
00:02:18,633 --> 00:02:19,900
Don't come back.

46
00:02:21,800 --> 00:02:23,033
I haven't decided yet...

47
00:02:26,033 --> 00:02:28,333
While he still hasn't seen your face

48
00:02:28,400 --> 00:02:30,132
go back to Singapore

49
00:02:30,133 --> 00:02:31,633
and never come back again.

50
00:02:32,533 --> 00:02:34,832
That way neither of you will get hurt.

51
00:02:34,833 --> 00:02:36,733
Time will wash it all away.

52
00:02:37,000 --> 00:02:39,100
Can time erase their father-son bond?

53
00:02:42,400 --> 00:02:44,233
Not every father-son bond

54
00:02:44,666 --> 00:02:46,133
is the way you imagine it.

55
00:02:46,400 --> 00:02:47,066
Auntie

56
00:02:47,266 --> 00:02:48,700
I've already backed down once.

57
00:02:49,033 --> 00:02:50,233
Please don't push me.

58
00:02:51,400 --> 00:02:52,466
Song Yi.

59
00:02:53,233 --> 00:02:54,600
I'll be honest with you.

60
00:02:55,200 --> 00:02:56,933
I don't dislike you at all.

61
00:02:57,766 --> 00:03:01,732
But you're playing an extremely
dangerous game right now.

62
00:03:02,100 --> 00:03:05,800
Dangerous enough to drag us all down
with you and hurt Xu Feiyu most of all.

63
00:03:05,866 --> 00:03:06,866
You...

64
00:03:06,933 --> 00:03:08,233
Do you understand?

65
00:03:10,733 --> 00:03:12,333
I think you're right.

66
00:03:12,933 --> 00:03:13,933
But please

67
00:03:14,433 --> 00:03:15,666
don't corner me.

68
00:04:00,800 --> 00:04:02,133
Song Yi's already gone.

69
00:04:08,133 --> 00:04:09,133
Feiyu.

70
00:04:50,633 --> 00:04:52,800
I thought you just felt sorry for Feiyu.

71
00:04:53,300 --> 00:04:55,466
Turns out
you want to save him too.

72
00:04:56,633 --> 00:04:58,400
But this love of yours

73
00:04:58,800 --> 00:05:00,100
has already crossed a line.

74
00:05:00,266 --> 00:05:01,266
Listen to me.

75
00:05:01,900 --> 00:05:03,000
Keep this up

76
00:05:03,300 --> 00:05:04,366
you'll lose control.

77
00:05:05,300 --> 00:05:06,900
I'm afraid it's already too late.

78
00:05:07,300 --> 00:05:09,166
You're not going to explain it to him?

79
00:05:12,233 --> 00:05:13,833
Could I even explain it?

80
00:05:14,400 --> 00:05:15,866
Everything right now

81
00:05:15,933 --> 00:05:17,133
is tangled up together.

82
00:05:18,066 --> 00:05:20,533
I don't even know what I want anymore.

83
00:05:27,433 --> 00:05:28,433
Playtime's over

84
00:05:28,466 --> 00:05:30,233
I already got a call from your dad.

85
00:05:30,600 --> 00:05:32,899
He wants you home for your graduation exam.

86
00:05:32,900 --> 00:05:33,533
Or else

87
00:05:33,534 --> 00:05:35,200
he'll come drag you back himself.

88
00:05:35,600 --> 00:05:36,033
Hey!

89
00:05:36,342 --> 00:05:37,277
You sold me out!

90
00:05:37,314 --> 00:05:38,679
How would I be able to do that?

91
00:05:38,933 --> 00:05:39,933
It was Xu Yun.

92
00:05:41,746 --> 00:05:43,613
She's the one who told my old man?

93
00:05:44,233 --> 00:05:45,933
Why would my old man listen to her?

94
00:05:47,633 --> 00:05:48,766
Song Yi.

95
00:05:49,833 --> 00:05:50,833
Go home.

96
00:05:51,466 --> 00:05:53,333
Leave things here to Xu Yun.

97
00:05:54,133 --> 00:05:55,666
I know she'll handle it.

98
00:05:56,133 --> 00:05:58,666
She's the one who
handled it all ten years ago.

99
00:05:59,366 --> 00:06:00,366
I don't trust her.

100
00:06:01,033 --> 00:06:02,366
Then do you trust me?

101
00:06:02,700 --> 00:06:04,465
I promise you.

102
00:06:04,466 --> 00:06:05,366
Xu Yun

103
00:06:05,367 --> 00:06:07,400
will get you the result you want.

104
00:06:07,700 --> 00:06:08,700
Yong Qi!

105
00:06:09,200 --> 00:06:10,599
Why do you trust a woman

106
00:06:10,600 --> 00:06:13,000
who treats marriage and kids as a deal?

107
00:06:13,233 --> 00:06:17,066
And I bet back then she cheated and slept
around leaving my old man left heartbroken.

108
00:06:17,833 --> 00:06:19,765
She doesn't love anyone.

109
00:06:19,766 --> 00:06:20,932
She only loves herself.

110
00:06:20,933 --> 00:06:22,333
There's a man she loves deeply.

111
00:06:22,633 --> 00:06:24,866
She loved him before
she ever met Song Yang.

112
00:06:33,333 --> 00:06:34,666
That man

113
00:06:35,833 --> 00:06:37,433
is a biology professor.

114
00:06:38,400 --> 00:06:40,366
He moved to Europe years ago.

115
00:06:40,933 --> 00:06:42,200
He never married

116
00:06:42,700 --> 00:06:44,300
but he adopted a daughter.

117
00:06:50,066 --> 00:06:51,066
Yong Qi

118
00:06:51,833 --> 00:06:53,466
how do you know all this?

119
00:06:54,400 --> 00:06:55,666
You know him?

120
00:07:00,500 --> 00:07:01,900
I'm that daughter.

121
00:07:08,300 --> 00:07:10,933
So the man Xu Yun cheated with back then…

122
00:07:11,300 --> 00:07:12,800
was your dad?

123
00:07:15,200 --> 00:07:16,466
My… dad?

124
00:07:18,033 --> 00:07:19,600
Then if that's true

125
00:07:20,033 --> 00:07:22,666
why marry my old man
back then and have a kid?

126
00:07:23,633 --> 00:07:24,633
No wait.

127
00:07:24,800 --> 00:07:26,433
So she cheated while married.

128
00:07:27,800 --> 00:07:28,833
Could it be?

129
00:07:28,933 --> 00:07:30,799
Xu Feiyu is your little brother?

130
00:07:30,800 --> 00:07:33,400
You've got one hell of an imagination.

131
00:07:33,666 --> 00:07:35,466
Feiyu is Song Yang's own son.

132
00:07:35,833 --> 00:07:37,166
But that doesn't add up.

133
00:07:37,866 --> 00:07:39,766
If Xu Yun was the one who cheated

134
00:07:40,133 --> 00:07:41,465
then all these years

135
00:07:41,466 --> 00:07:43,166
she kept father and son apart

136
00:07:43,633 --> 00:07:45,100
and my old man just took it.

137
00:07:45,900 --> 00:07:46,966
Why is that?

138
00:07:47,700 --> 00:07:50,399
Look at how crazed you are right now.

139
00:07:50,400 --> 00:07:51,533
Can you think straight?

140
00:07:51,766 --> 00:07:52,633
You want to know?

141
00:07:52,700 --> 00:07:53,933
Go home and ask Song Yang.

142
00:08:03,200 --> 00:08:04,266
Song Yi.

143
00:08:06,633 --> 00:08:09,800
Neither of us wants Feiyu getting hurt.

144
00:08:10,233 --> 00:08:11,233
Right?

145
00:08:11,300 --> 00:08:12,300
Yeah.

146
00:08:13,166 --> 00:08:14,366
Then go back to Singapore.

147
00:08:15,266 --> 00:08:16,700
It's better for everyone.

148
00:08:44,600 --> 00:08:45,600
Your tea.

149
00:08:45,600 --> 00:08:46,466
Enjoy.

150
00:08:46,466 --> 00:08:47,466
Okay thanks.

151
00:08:48,833 --> 00:08:49,833
Feiyu?

152
00:08:54,633 --> 00:08:56,233
You came here alone again?

153
00:08:57,666 --> 00:08:58,666
Just passing by.

154
00:09:04,466 --> 00:09:05,865
Song Yi...

155
00:09:05,866 --> 00:09:07,066
went out this morning

156
00:09:07,200 --> 00:09:08,200
and he's not back yet.

157
00:09:10,966 --> 00:09:12,866
You... you want to come in and wait?

158
00:09:16,733 --> 00:09:17,233
No need.

159
00:09:17,433 --> 00:09:18,565
Let me take you home.

160
00:09:18,589 --> 00:09:19,289
It's too dangerous

161
00:09:19,466 --> 00:09:20,466
I called a car.

162
00:09:20,866 --> 00:09:21,899
I'm taking you home.

163
00:09:21,900 --> 00:09:22,900
Don't!

164
00:09:49,900 --> 00:09:52,766
Hey! Move! Hey hey! Move!

165
00:09:56,833 --> 00:09:57,900
Move move move!

166
00:10:12,733 --> 00:10:13,266
Ugh.

167
00:10:13,433 --> 00:10:14,433
Ah!

168
00:10:14,866 --> 00:10:15,866
Ugh.

169
00:10:22,533 --> 00:10:23,533
Song Yi.

170
00:10:30,500 --> 00:10:31,500
Song Yi.

171
00:10:32,900 --> 00:10:33,933
Song Yi.

172
00:10:36,700 --> 00:10:37,900
Song Yi!

173
00:10:39,200 --> 00:10:40,865
Song Yi come out!

174
00:10:40,866 --> 00:10:43,032
I know it's you.

175
00:10:43,033 --> 00:10:44,233
Song Yi!

176
00:11:29,200 --> 00:11:30,466
You saw him home?

177
00:11:32,033 --> 00:11:32,266
Yeah.

178
00:11:32,500 --> 00:11:33,799
Waited till he was inside.

179
00:11:33,800 --> 00:11:35,566
Why put yourself through this?

180
00:11:35,766 --> 00:11:37,466
If he comes here every day

181
00:11:38,000 --> 00:11:39,800
you'll walk him home every day?

182
00:11:41,066 --> 00:11:42,400
I can't stay in that house.

183
00:11:42,910 --> 00:11:43,976
Yours is the only place...

184
00:11:44,000 --> 00:11:45,633
But staying here solves nothing.

185
00:11:46,533 --> 00:11:48,200
If you went back to Singapore

186
00:11:48,333 --> 00:11:50,033
he'd stop coming around.

187
00:11:52,066 --> 00:11:53,700
I haven't figured out what to do.

188
00:11:54,133 --> 00:11:55,133
I can't leave now.

189
00:11:56,400 --> 00:11:57,866
Then take your time.

190
00:11:58,100 --> 00:11:59,465
He comes here every day

191
00:11:59,466 --> 00:12:01,165
with all that traffic out there

192
00:12:01,166 --> 00:12:02,366
there'll be an accident.

193
00:12:03,866 --> 00:12:04,866
Xu Yun.

194
00:12:04,900 --> 00:12:06,133
How is Feiyu?

195
00:12:09,266 --> 00:12:10,800
I have him settled now.

196
00:12:13,133 --> 00:12:14,133
Okay.

197
00:12:14,333 --> 00:12:15,333
You two talk.

198
00:12:15,400 --> 00:12:16,400
I'll be in the back.

199
00:12:21,800 --> 00:12:23,833
You know why I came to see you, don't you?

200
00:12:24,733 --> 00:12:25,066
Yes.

201
00:12:25,067 --> 00:12:26,233
Then I will speak plainly.

202
00:12:26,300 --> 00:12:28,433
If he has an accident on the road

203
00:12:28,500 --> 00:12:30,232
or gets too emotionally shaken

204
00:12:30,233 --> 00:12:32,699
his vision will fail or he
will go blind for good.

205
00:12:32,700 --> 00:12:33,700
Am I right?

206
00:12:34,400 --> 00:12:35,400
Yes.

207
00:12:35,466 --> 00:12:37,632
So do you think you should be staying here

208
00:12:37,633 --> 00:12:39,000
putting him at risk?

209
00:12:41,033 --> 00:12:43,500
I could also stay with him and say nothing.

210
00:12:44,266 --> 00:12:45,266
Song Yi.

211
00:12:45,866 --> 00:12:47,700
I know why you want to stay

212
00:12:48,633 --> 00:12:50,366
and I cannot allow that either.

213
00:12:52,233 --> 00:12:54,566
So everyone just has to obey you?

214
00:12:54,933 --> 00:12:57,000
Who are you to make demands of everyone?

215
00:13:00,233 --> 00:13:01,966
I know you resent me deeply.

216
00:13:04,500 --> 00:13:05,900
What happened in the past.

217
00:13:06,433 --> 00:13:07,865
I regret it too.

218
00:13:07,866 --> 00:13:10,133
Does one word of regret erase everything?

219
00:13:11,077 --> 00:13:13,342
I will not make excuses for the past.

220
00:13:13,366 --> 00:13:14,832
I admit I hurt all of you

221
00:13:14,833 --> 00:13:15,999
and I hurt Xu Feiyu too.

222
00:13:16,023 --> 00:13:17,523
But what you are doing now...

223
00:13:17,600 --> 00:13:19,665
how is it different from what I did?

224
00:13:19,666 --> 00:13:22,032
Won't it hurt Xu Feiyu just as badly?

225
00:13:22,056 --> 00:13:23,056
I...!

226
00:13:23,633 --> 00:13:24,865
It took everything we had

227
00:13:24,866 --> 00:13:26,299
to climb out of that abyss.

228
00:13:26,300 --> 00:13:28,532
Do not create another one.

229
00:13:28,533 --> 00:13:29,533
Please!

230
00:13:29,566 --> 00:13:33,233
What worries me is that Xu Feiyu
never truly climbed out of that abyss.

231
00:13:33,266 --> 00:13:35,333
You think his own mother doesn't know?

232
00:13:36,466 --> 00:13:37,933
I am begging you.

233
00:13:38,966 --> 00:13:41,600
Go back to Singapore and never come back!

234
00:13:47,933 --> 00:13:48,933
Could I stay

235
00:13:48,966 --> 00:13:50,366
until his bandages come off?

236
00:13:51,466 --> 00:13:52,466
No.

237
00:13:52,933 --> 00:13:54,833
Then he would see your face.

238
00:13:57,000 --> 00:13:58,500
If he never knows your face

239
00:13:59,333 --> 00:14:00,866
he will have no way to find you

240
00:14:02,400 --> 00:14:03,733
and he can truly forget you.

241
00:14:08,866 --> 00:14:09,866
All right.

242
00:14:14,866 --> 00:14:15,966
Song Yi.

243
00:14:17,100 --> 00:14:18,766
You're a good kid.

244
00:14:20,400 --> 00:14:22,100
Mr. Song didn't raise you for nothing.

245
00:15:12,333 --> 00:15:13,333
Who's there?

246
00:15:27,300 --> 00:15:28,300
Song Yi!

247
00:15:29,033 --> 00:15:30,033
Well, well.

248
00:15:30,500 --> 00:15:31,500
So now you can

249
00:15:31,533 --> 00:15:32,933
tell who it is just by the smell.

250
00:15:36,066 --> 00:15:37,333
Weren't you avoiding me?

251
00:15:37,600 --> 00:15:38,960
Weren't you keeping your distance?

252
00:15:39,866 --> 00:15:41,026
So why come running back now?

253
00:15:42,400 --> 00:15:43,700
Nobody was avoiding you.

254
00:15:44,433 --> 00:15:45,566
Yesterday I

255
00:15:46,266 --> 00:15:47,500
just happened to be out.

256
00:15:47,900 --> 00:15:48,400
Heh heh.

257
00:15:48,533 --> 00:15:50,533
You dare say that wasn't you yesterday?

258
00:15:51,200 --> 00:15:52,466
It was not.

259
00:15:52,900 --> 00:15:54,766
I went to buy exam prep books.

260
00:15:55,100 --> 00:15:55,400
Hm?

261
00:15:55,933 --> 00:15:56,200
Hmph.

262
00:15:56,300 --> 00:15:57,300
Keep up the act.

263
00:15:57,600 --> 00:15:59,000
So how's the studying going?

264
00:15:59,400 --> 00:16:00,400
Mm…

265
00:16:00,633 --> 00:16:01,633
Not bad, I guess.

266
00:16:02,133 --> 00:16:03,133
But

267
00:16:03,300 --> 00:16:04,866
I might go back for tutoring soon.

268
00:16:04,933 --> 00:16:05,333
What?

269
00:16:05,900 --> 00:16:06,266
You

270
00:16:06,900 --> 00:16:08,133
came here to say goodbye?

271
00:16:09,800 --> 00:16:10,966
What are you talking about?

272
00:16:11,233 --> 00:16:12,533
No way.

273
00:16:12,913 --> 00:16:14,413
I'm just going back for the exam.

274
00:16:14,566 --> 00:16:15,733
I'll come right back after.

275
00:16:16,733 --> 00:16:17,733
Really?

276
00:16:17,966 --> 00:16:18,966
Really!

277
00:16:19,133 --> 00:16:20,133
Why would I lie to you?

278
00:16:20,166 --> 00:16:23,500
But didn't we agree that I'd see
you the day my bandages come off?

279
00:16:24,293 --> 00:16:25,726
That doesn't matter.

280
00:16:26,100 --> 00:16:27,266
I'll see you when I'm back.

281
00:16:28,133 --> 00:16:29,133
Oh right,

282
00:16:29,259 --> 00:16:30,559
let me warn you in advance

283
00:16:31,166 --> 00:16:32,166
when the time comes

284
00:16:32,933 --> 00:16:33,966
don't call me ugly.

285
00:16:35,500 --> 00:16:36,500
Mm.

286
00:16:36,733 --> 00:16:38,266
You probably aren't much to look at.

287
00:16:39,066 --> 00:16:39,233
Heh.

288
00:16:39,366 --> 00:16:39,766
Hey!

289
